m into an unexpected fan favorite — and a threat to the entire system. As ratings skyrocket, so does the danger, and Ben must outwit not just the Hunters, but a nation addicted to watching him fall.\",\"rating\":6.3,\"audienceRating\":7.8,\"skipCount\":1,\"year\":2025,\"tagline\":\"Hunt him down.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/19662/thumb/1768838614\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/19662/art/1768838614\",\"duration\":8185120,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2025-11-11\",\"addedAt\":1766040012,\"updatedAt\":1768838614,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"chapterSource\":\"media\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/19663\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.ripe\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":41687,\"duration\":8185120,\"bitrate\":10613,\"width\":1920,\"height\":800,\"aspectRatio\":2.35,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"eac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mp4\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"optimizedForStreaming\":0,\"has64bitOffsets\":true,\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":41687,\"key\":\"/library/parts/41687/1765451687/file.mp4\",\"duration\":8185120,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/The.Running.Man.2025.1080p.AMZN.WEB-DL.DDP5.1.H264.MP4-BEN.THE.MEN/The.Running.Man.2025.1080p.AMZN.WEB-DL[Ben The Men].mp4\",\"size\":10858626191,\"container\":\"mp4\",\"failureBIFResultCode\":\"3\",\"failureBIFRetryCount\":\"2\",\"has64bitOffsets\":true,\"hasThumbnail\":\"1\",\"optimizedForStreaming\":false,\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"The Running Man\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/19662/thumb/1768838614\"},{\"alt\":\"The Running Man\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/19662/art/1768838614\"},{\"alt\":\"The Running Man\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/19662/clearLogo/1768838614\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"570f08\",\"topRight\":\"a32f1f\",\"bottomRight\":\"963725\",\"bottomL