\"contentRatingAge\":16,\"summary\":\"Returning to the house where his family was brutally murdered during the war, \\\"the man who refuses to die\\\" (Jorma Tommila) dismantles it, loads it on a truck, and is determined to rebuild it somewhere safe in their honor. When the Red Army commander who killed his family (Stephen Lang) comes back hellbent on finishing the job, a relentless, eye-popping cross-country chase ensues - a fight to the death.\",\"rating\":9.5,\"audienceRating\":8.7,\"year\":2025,\"tagline\":\"When they took his family, he took revenge.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/18800/thumb/1768838605\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/18800/art/1768838605\",\"duration\":5354976,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2025-10-22\",\"addedAt\":1766028429,\"updatedAt\":1768838605,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.ripe\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":40329,\"duration\":5354976,\"bitrate\":10703,\"width\":1920,\"height\":804,\"aspectRatio\":2.35,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"eac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":40329,\"key\":\"/library/parts/40329/1765864553/file.mkv\",\"duration\":5354976,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/www.UIndex.org    -    Sisu.Road.To.Revenge.2025.1080p.WEB.h264-ETHEL/Sisu.Road.To.Revenge.2025.1080p.WEB.h264-ETHEL.mkv\",\"size\":7164078517,\"container\":\"mkv\",\"indexes\":\"sd\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"Sisu: Road to Revenge\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/18800/thumb/1768838605\"},{\"alt\":\"Sisu: Road to Revenge\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/18800/art/1768838605\"},{\"alt\":\"Sisu: Road to Revenge\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/18800/clearLogo/1768838605\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"4c1e0d\",\"topRight\":\"973f13\",\"bottomR