Cinema\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"The Conjuring: Last Rites\",\"titleSort\":\"Conjuring: Last Rites\",\"contentRating\":\"R\",\"contentRatingAge\":16,\"summary\":\"Paranormal investigators, Ed & Lorraine Warren take on their most disturbing case to date. Jack & Janet Smurl and their family, move into a brand new home they've dreamed of, which turned into a nightmare as their home begins to show signs of demonic infestation.\",\"rating\":5.8,\"audienceRating\":7.7,\"year\":2025,\"tagline\":\"The case that ended it all.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/13994/thumb/1768838585\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/13994/art/1768838585\",\"duration\":8149971,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2025-09-03\",\"addedAt\":1763165779,\"updatedAt\":1768838585,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"chapterSource\":\"media\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/14195\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.rotten\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":24250,\"duration\":8149971,\"bitrate\":2229,\"width\":1920,\"height\":800,\"aspectRatio\":2.35,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"aac\",\"videoCodec\":\"hevc\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"audioProfile\":\"he-aac\",\"videoProfile\":\"main 10\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":24250,\"key\":\"/library/parts/24250/1759784246/file.mkv\",\"duration\":8149971,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/www.UIndex.org    -    The Conjuring Last Rites 2025 REPACK 1080p 10bit WEBRip 6CH x265 HEVC-PSA/The Conjuring Last Rites 2025 REPACK 1080p 10bit WEBRip 6CH x265 HEVC-PSA.mkv\",\"size\":2270671738,\"audioProfile\":\"he-aac\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"indexes\":\"sd\",\"videoProfile\":\"main 10\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"The Conjuring: Last Rites\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/13994/thumb/1768838585\"},{\"alt\":\"The Conjuring: Last Rites\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/13994/art/1768838585\"},{\"alt\":\"The Conjuring: Last Rites\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/13994/clearLogo/1768838585\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"020c15\",\"topRight\":\"5c1112\",\"bottomRight\":\"5b1315\",\"bottomLeft\":\"041312\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Horror\"},{\"tag\":\"Mystery\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"United States of America\"}],\"Director\":[{\"tag\":\"Michael Chaves\"}],\"Writer\":[{\"tag\":\"David Leslie Johnson-McGoldrick\"},{\"tag\":\"James Wan\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"Patrick Wilson\"},{\"tag\":\"Vera Farmiga\"},{\"tag\":\"Mia Tomlinson\"}]},{\"ratingKey\":\"21021\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/21021\",\"guid\":\"plex://movie/68c604eb69b59daa2d13442c\",\"slug\":\"restless-2025-1\",\"studio\":\"Jensony Productions\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Restless\",\"summary\":\"Restless follows Jamie, a young man unraveling after countless nights without rest. As exhaustion eats away at his reality, he drifts through a world where mirrors show daylight, taps bleed, and the doorbell delivers only silence. Haunted by the relentless sound of his own heartbeat, Jamie can't tell where the dream ends and the waking begins. Trapped in a cycle of night terrors and hallucinations, he searches for one thing he may never find - just one good sleep.\",\"year\":2025,\"tagline\":\"When sleep won't come, reality breaks\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/21021/thumb/1766371638\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/21021/art/1766371638\",\"duration\":5335205,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2025-08-29\",\"addedAt\":1766227375,\"updatedAt\":1766371638,\"chapterSource\":\"media\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":43735,\"duration\":5335205,\"bitrate\":9052,\"width\":1920,\"height\":960,\"aspectRatio\":1.85,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"eac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":43735,\"key\":\"/library/parts/43735/1760322846/file.mkv\",\"duration\":5335205,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mn