            "text": "{\"MediaContainer\":{\"size\":12,\"totalSize\":12,\"offset\":0,\"allowSync\":true,\"art\":\"/:/resources/movie-fanart.jpg\",\"identifier\":\"com.plexapp.plugins.library\",\"librarySectionID\":1,\"librarySectionTitle\":\"Movies\",\"librarySectionUUID\":\"d0cc0b98-03c3-462c-aaf7-50514a8237a8\",\"mediaTagPrefix\":\"/system/bundle/media/flags/\",\"mediaTagVersion\":1758205129,\"thumb\":\"/:/resources/movie.png\",\"title1\":\"Movies\",\"title2\":\"All Movies\",\"viewGroup\":\"movie\",\"viewMode\":65592,\"Metadata\":[{\"ratingKey\":\"14126\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/14126\",\"guid\":\"plex://movie/627b6faaef5508740b16ef7c\",\"slug\":\"wicked-for-good\",\"studio\":\"Universal Pictures\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Wicked: For Good\",\"contentRating\":\"PG\",\"contentRatingAge\":11,\"summary\":\"After challenging the Wizard's totalitarian regime in Oz, Elphaba must grapple with her identity as the \\\"Wicked Witch of the West.\\\" Meanwhile, the Wizard has given Glinda the title \\\"Glinda the Good\\\" and a public status as the nation's defender against Elphaba. The two witches must make decisions that seal their fates in this second musical installment.\",\"rating\":6.6,\"audienceRating\":9.3,\"userRating\":10.0,\"viewCount\":1,\"lastViewedAt\":1766015801,\"lastRatedAt\":1766019467,\"year\":2025,\"tagline\":\"You will be changed.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/14126/thumb/1768838587\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/14126/art/1768838587\",\"duration\":7668469,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2025-11-19\",\"addedAt\":1765781680,\"updatedAt\":1768838587,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/14127\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.ripe\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":28085,\"duration\":7668469,\"bitrate\":1764,\"width\":1920,\"height\":800,\"aspectRatio\":2.35,\"audioChannels\":2,\"audioCodec\":\"aac\",\"videoCodec\":\"hevc\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"audioProfile\":\"lc\",\"videoProfile\":\"main\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":28085,\"key\":\"/library/parts/28085/1764775464/file.mkv\",\"duration\":7668469,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/wicked.for.good.2025.v2.1080p.hevc.x265.rmteam/wicked.for.good.2025.v2.1080p.hevc.x265.rmteam.mkv\",\"size\":1690568957,\"audioProfile\":\"lc\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"indexes\":\"sd\",\"videoProfile\":\"main\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"Wicked: For Good\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/14126/thumb/1768838587\"},{\"alt\":\"Wicked: For Good\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/14126/art/1768838587\"},{\"alt\":\"Wicked: For Good\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/14126/clearLogo/1768838587\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"372c10\",\"topRight\":\"3f6b2c\",\"bottomRight\":\"853d82\",\"bottomLeft\":\"6d5520\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Family\"},{\"tag\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"United States of America\"}],\"Director\":[{\"tag\":\"Jon M. Chu\"}],\"Writer\":[{\"tag\":\"Stephen Schwartz\"},{\"tag\":\"Winnie Holzman\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"Cynthia Erivo\"},{\"tag\":\"Ariana Grande\"},{\"tag\":\"Jeff Goldblum\"}]},{\"ratingKey\":\"9190\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/9190\",\"guid\":\"plex://movie/5d776c8a23d5a3001f51c946\",\"slug\":\"deadpool-and-wolverine\",\"studio\":\"Marvel Studios\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Deadpool & Wolverine\",\"contentRating\":\"R\",\"contentRatingAge\":17,\"summary\":\"In this multiverse story Deadpool is approached by a man named Paradox who intends on vaporizing his entire universe because apparently it's not supposed to go on living without the now deceased hero Wolverine. Deadpool kidnaps another version of Wolverine to replace but this only results in Paradox banishing both Deadpool and Wolverine.\",\"rating\":7.8,\"audienceRating\":9.4,\"viewCount\":1,\"lastViewedAt\":1722146779,\"year\":2024,\"tagline\":\"Come together.\",\"thumb\":