nt with all your favorite South Park characters!\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/19/thumb/1768838548\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/19/art/1768838548\",\"duration\":2924964,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2023-10-27\",\"addedAt\":1762637775,\"updatedAt\":1768838548,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":37,\"duration\":2924964,\"bitrate\":4499,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"aspectRatio\":1.78,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"eac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":37,\"key\":\"/library/parts/37/1757838625/file.mkv\",\"duration\":2924964,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/www.UIndex.org    -    South Park Joining The Panderverse 2023 REPACK 1080p AMZN WEB-DL DDP5 1 H 264-FLUX/South Park Joining The Panderverse 2023 REPACK 1080p AMZN WEB-DL DDP5 1 H 264-FLUX.mkv\",\"size\":1644895896,\"container\":\"mkv\",\"failureBIFResultCode\":\"3\",\"failureBIFRetryCount\":\"1\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"South Park: Joining the Panderverse\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/19/thumb/1768838548\"},{\"alt\":\"South Park: Joining the Panderverse\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/19/art/1768838548\"},{\"alt\":\"South Park: Joining the Panderverse\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/19/clearLogo/1768838548\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"3f2809\",\"topRight\":\"833340\",\"bottomRight\":\"9a392c\",\"bottomLeft\":\"993a2d\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Animation\"},{\"tag\":\"Comedy\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"United States of America\"}],\"Director\":[{\"tag\":\"Trey Parker\"}],\"Writer\":[{\"tag\":\"Trey Parker\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"Trey Parker\"},{\"tag\":\"Matt Stone\"},{\"tag\":\"April Stewart\"}]},{\"ratingKey\":\"15\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/15\",\"guid\":\"plex://movie/62bdf2115c2087fe401e61be\",\"slug\":\"south-park-the-streaming-wars-part-2\",\"studio\":\"MTV Entertainment Studios\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"South Park: The Streaming Wars Part 2\",\"contentRating\":\"R\",\"summary\":\"The streaming wars have ended and the drought in Colorado is worse than ever. Mr Pipi hits upon the idea of using pee as a substitute for water...in all situations...and gains much traction with this after major stars appear in his ads. Karen Marsh goes back to being Randy Marsh, scientist, and tries to find a better solution to the water shortage.\",\"audienceRating\":7.2,\"viewCount\":1,\"lastViewedAt\":1717065761,\"year\":2022,\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/15/thumb/1768838547\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/15/art/1768838547\",\"duration\":3078493,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2022-07-13\",\"addedAt\":1762637734,\"updatedAt\":1768838547,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"chapterSource\":\"media\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/20\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":29,\"duration\":3078493,\"bitrate\":2639,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"aspectRatio\":1.78,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"aac\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mp4\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"optimizedForStreaming\":1,\"audioProfile\":\"lc\",\"has64bitOffsets\":false,\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":29,\"key\":\"/library/parts/29/1729479276/file.mp4\",\"duration\":3078493,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/South Park The Streaming Wars Part 2 (2022) [1080p] [BluRay] [5.1] [YTS.MX]/South.Park.The.Streaming.Wars.Part.2.2022.1080p.BluRay.x264.AAC5.1-[YTS.MX].mp4\",\"size\":1015645431,\"audioProfile\":\"lc\",\"container\":\"mp4\",\"failureBIFResultCode\":\"3\",\"failureBIFRetryCount\":\"1\",\"has64bitOffsets\":false,\"optimizedForStreaming\":true,\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"South Park: The Streaming Wars Part 2\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/15/thumb/1768838547\"},{\"alt\":\"South Park: The Streaming Wars Part 2\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/15/art/1768838547\"},{\"alt\":\"South Park: The Streaming Wars Part 2\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/15/clearLogo/1768838547\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"501912\",\"topRight\":\"711a03\",\"bottomRight\":\"ad152a\",\"bottomLeft\":\"356b43\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Animation\"},{\"tag\":\"Comedy\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"United States of America\"}],\"Director\":[{\"tag\":\"Trey Parker\"}],\"Writer\":[{\"tag\":\"Trey Parker\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"Trey Parker\"},{\"tag\":\"Matt Stone\"},{\"tag\":\"April Stewart\"}]},{\"ratingKey\":\"12\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/12\",\"guid\":\"plex://movie/614236f94ee27aea449c2703\",\"slug\":\"south-park-the-streaming-wars-2022-1\",\"studio\":\"MTV Entertainment Studios\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"South Park: The Streaming Wars\",\"contentRating\":\"R\",\"summary\":\"Colorado is experiencing a drought, making water a highly valuable commodity. Due to their locations, certain farms have an abundance of water. One such farms is Tegridy Weed, owned by Randy Marsh. After his neighbour sells a portion of his water rights Randy does the same. Soon other farmers are selling their water, starting a streaming war. Stan, Kyle and the boys are profiting from this as they are making small boats for the warring streamers.\",\"audienceRating\":6.0,\"viewCount\":1,\"lastViewedAt\":1716982758,\"year\":2022,\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/12/thumb/1768838544\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/12/art/1768838544\",\"duration\":2888176,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2022-06-01\",\"addedAt\":1762637725,\"updatedAt\":1768838544,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"chapterSource\":\"media\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/7843\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":22,\"duration\":2888176,\"bitrate\":27250,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"aspectRatio\":1.78,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"truehd\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":22,\"key\":\"/library/parts/22/1755354548/file.mkv\",\"duration\":2888176,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/www.UIndex.org    -    South Park The Streaming Wars 2022 1080p BluRay REMUX TrueHD 5 1-UnKn0wn/South Park The Streaming Wars 2022 1080p BluRay REMUX TrueHD 5 1-UnKn0wn.mkv\",\"size\":9837927804,\"container\":\"mkv\",\"failureBIFResultCode\":\"3\",\"failureBIFRetryCount\":\"1\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"South Park: The Streaming Wars\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/12/thumb/1768838544\"},{\"alt\":\"South Park: The Streaming Wars\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/12/art/1768838544\"},{\"alt\":\"South Park: The Streaming Wars\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/12/clearLogo/1768838544\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"511812\",\"topRight\":\"4856a3\",\"bottomRight\":\"914507\",\"bottomLeft\":\"9c2732\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Animation\"},{\"tag\":\"Comedy\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"United States of America\"}],\"Director\":[{\"tag\":\"Trey Parker\"}],\"Writer\":[{\"tag\":\"Trey Parker\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"Trey Parker\"},{\"tag\":\"Matt Stone\"},{\"tag\":\"April Stewart\"}]},{\"ratingKey\":\"7\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/7\",\"guid\":\"plex://movie/61b21e794e7483d7d338fe8b\",\"slug\":\"south-park-post-covid-the-return-of-covid\",\"studio\":\"MTV Entertainment Studios\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"South Park: Post COVID: The Return of COVID\",\"contentRating\":\"R\",\"summary\":\"If Stan, Kyle and Cartman could just work together, they could go back in time to make sure Covid never happened and save Kenny's life. Traveling back to the past seems to be the easy answer until they meet Victor Chaos.\",\"audienceRating\":6.9,\"viewCount\":1,\"lastViewedAt\":1716866791,\"year\"