\"PG\",\"contentRatingAge\":6,\"summary\":\"Santa's clumsy son Arthur sets out on a mission with Grandsanta to give out a misplaced present to a young girl in less than two hours on Christmas Day.\",\"rating\":9.3,\"audienceRating\":7.7,\"year\":2011,\"tagline\":\"Ever wonder how 2 Billion presents get delivered all in 1 night?\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/22500/thumb/1766236093\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/22500/art/1766236093\",\"duration\":5852864,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2011-11-11\",\"addedAt\":1766236081,\"updatedAt\":1766236093,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"chapterSource\":\"media\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/22511\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.ripe\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":47320,\"duration\":5852864,\"bitrate\":15678,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1040,\"aspectRatio\":1.85,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"ac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":47320,\"key\":\"/library/parts/47320/1716461349/file.mkv\",\"duration\":5852864,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/Arthur Christmas.2011.BluRay.1080p.x264-LEONARDO_[scarabey.org]/Arthur Christmas.2011.BluRay.1080p.x264-LEONARDO_[scarabey.org].mkv\",\"size\":11470392921,\"container\":\"mkv\",\"failureBIFResultCode\":\"3\",\"failureBIFRetryCount\":\"2\",\"hasThumbnail\":\"1\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"Arthur Christmas\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/22500/thumb/1766236093\"},{\"alt\":\"Arthur Christmas\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/22500/art/1766236093\"},{\"alt\":\"Arthur Christmas\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/22500/clearLogo/1766236093\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"55120d\",\"topRight\":\"1d3923\",\"bottomRight\":\"aa2022\",\"bottomLeft\":\"346c35\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Family\"},{\"tag\":\"Drama\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"United Kingdom\"},{\"tag\":\"United States of America\"}],\"Director\":[{\"tag\":\"Sarah Smith\"}],\"Writer\":[{\"tag\":\"Sarah Smith\"},{\"tag\":\"Peter Baynham\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"James McAvoy\"},{\"tag\":\"Hugh Laurie\"},{\"tag\":\"Bill Nighy\"}]},{\"ratingKey\":\"19165\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/19165\",\"guid\":\"plex://movie/65594efbbd193b2096e61106\",\"slug\":\"the-bad-guys-2-2025-1\",\"studio\":\"DreamWorks Animation\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"The Bad Guys 2\",\"titleSort\":\"Bad Guys 2\",\"librarySectionTitle\":\"Movies\",\"librarySectionID\":1,\"librarySectionKey\":\"/library/sections/1\",\"contentRating\":\"PG\",\"contentRatingAge\":6,\"summary\":\"The Bad Guys are struggling to find trust and acceptance in their newly minted lives as Good Guys, when they are pulled out of retirement and forced to do \\\"one last job\\\" by an all-female squad of criminals.\",\"rating\":8.7,\"audienceRating\":9.4,\"year\":2025,\"tagline\":\"Back in badness.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/19165/thumb/1766101999\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/19165/art/1766101999\",\"duration\":6231968,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2025-07-23\",\"addedAt\":1766036331,\"updatedAt\":1766101999,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/20785\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.ripe\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":41151,\"duration\":6231968,\"bitrate\":10693,\"width\":1920,\"height\":800,\"aspectRatio\":2.35,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"eac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":41151,\"key\":\"/library/parts/41151/1755591596/file.mkv\",\"duration\":6231968,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/www.UIndex.org    -    The.Bad.Guys.2.2025.iNTERNAL.MULTi.1080p.WEB.H264-LUCKY/The.Bad.Guys.2.2025.iNTERNAL.MULTi.1080p.WEB.H264-LUCKY.mkv\",\"size\":8330181369,\"container\":\"mkv\",\"failureBIFResultCode\":\"3\",\"failureBIFRetryCount\":\"2\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"The Bad Guys 2\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/19165/thumb/1766101999\"},{\"alt\":\"The Bad Guys 2\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/19165/art/1766101999\"},{\"alt\":\"The Bad Guys 2\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/19165/clearLogo/1766101999\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"412610\",\"topRight\":\"844e2b\",\"bottomRight\":\"5e3a1c\",\"bottomLeft\":\"8e4535\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Animation\"},{\"tag\":\"Action\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"United States of America\"}],\"Director\":[{\"tag\":\"Pierre Perifel\"}],\"Writer\":[{\"tag\":\"Katherine de Vries\"},{\"tag\":\"Yoni Brenner\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"Sam Rockwell\"},{\"tag\":\"Marc Maron\"},{\"tag\":\"Awkwafina\"}]},{\"ratingKey\":\"14595\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/14595\",\"guid\":\"plex://movie/5d9f351fca3253001ef27f25\",\"slug\":\"barbie-as-rapunzel\",\"studio\":\"Mainframe Entertainment\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Barbie as Rapunzel\",\"librarySectionTitle\":\"Movies\",\"librarySectionID\":1,\"librarySectionKey\":\"/library/sections/1\",\"contentRating\":\"G\",\"contentRatingAge\":5,\"summary\":\"Barbie stars as Rapunzel, a young girl who is entrapped by a magical barrier by the wicked, Gothel. Rapunzel finds an escape where she finds a Prince and a feud between two kingdoms which goes back to the day she was kidnapped as a child.\",\"audienceRating\":6.8,\"year\":2002,\"tagline\":\"Love and imagination can change the world.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/14595/thumb/1765849327\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/14595/art/1765849327\",\"duration\":5025487,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2002-09-30\",\"addedAt\":1765849325,\"updatedAt\":1765849327,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"chapterSource\":\"media\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/14596\",\"Media\":