endship when she meets her humble look-alike, Erika. Will the Princess and the Pauper thwart the plans of the Queen's scheming advisor, Preminger?\",\"audienceRating\":7.7,\"year\":2004,\"tagline\":\"Singing in her first movie musical!\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/1338/thumb/1766022139\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/1338/art/1766022139\",\"duration\":5360384,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2004-09-28\",\"addedAt\":1762648381,\"updatedAt\":1766022139,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/1341\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":2232,\"duration\":5360384,\"bitrate\":2630,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"aspectRatio\":1.78,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"aac\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mp4\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"optimizedForStreaming\":1,\"audioProfile\":\"lc\",\"has64bitOffsets\":false,\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":2232,\"key\":\"/library/parts/2232/1711392717/file.mp4\",\"duration\":5360384,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/Barbie As The Princess And The Pauper (2004) [1080p] [WEBRip] [5.1] [YTS.MX]/Barbie.As.The.Princess.And.The.Pauper.2004.1080p.WEBRip.x264.AAC5.1-[YTS.MX].mp4\",\"size\":1762308223,\"audioProfile\":\"lc\",\"container\":\"mp4\",\"failureBIFResultCode\":\"3\",\"failureBIFRetryCount\":\"1\",\"has64bitOffsets\":false,\"optimizedForStreaming\":true,\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"Barbie as The Princess and the Pauper\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/1338/thumb/1766022139\"},{\"alt\":\"Barbie as The Princess and the Pauper\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/1338/art/1766022139\"},{\"alt\":\"Barbie as The Princess and the Pauper\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/1338/clearLogo/1766022139\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"2b030b\",\"topRight\":\"924040\",\"bottomRight\":\"91423c\",\"bottomLeft\":\"3e3848\"},\"Genre\":[