o is intent on tormenting his dad. Gru faces a new nemesis in Maxime Le Mal and his girlfriend Valentina, and the family is forced to go on the run.\",\"rating\":5.5,\"audienceRating\":8.6,\"viewCount\":1,\"lastViewedAt\":1720525638,\"year\":2024,\"tagline\":\"Things just got a little more despicable.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/18696/thumb/1768838598\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/18696/art/1768838598\",\"duration\":5663680,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2024-06-20\",\"addedAt\":1766028320,\"updatedAt\":1768838598,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"chapterSource\":\"media\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/18698\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.rotten\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":40061,\"duration\":5663680,\"bitrate\":34340,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"aspectRatio\":1.78,\"audioChannels\":8,\"audioCodec\":\"truehd\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":40061,\"key\":\"/library/parts/40061/1726271921/file.mkv\",\"duration\":5663680,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/Despicable Me 4 2024 1080p Blu-ray Remux AVC TrueHD Atmos 7 1-CiNEPHiLES/Despicable Me 4 2024 1080p Blu-ray Remux AVC TrueHD Atmos 7 1-CiNEPHiLES.mkv\",\"size\":24311351105,\"container\":\"mkv\",\"indexes\":\"sd\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"Despicable Me 4\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/18696/thumb/1768838598\"},{\"alt\":\"Despicable Me 4\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/18696/art/1768838598\"},{\"alt\":\"Despicable Me 4\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/18696/clearLogo/1768838598\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"191f72\",\"topRight\":\"993c16\",\"bottomRight\":\"052a41\",\"bottomLeft\":\"2b04cb\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Animation\"},{\"tag\":\"Adventure\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"United States of America\"}],\"Direct