discover a charming, once peaceful kingdom that has been plunged into eternal winter by the evil White Witch, Jadis. Aided by the wise and magnificent lion, Aslan, the children lead Narnia into a spectacular, climactic battle to be free of the Witch's glacial powers forever.\",\"rating\":7.6,\"audienceRating\":6.1,\"year\":2005,\"tagline\":\"The beloved masterpiece comes to life.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/154/thumb/1766022138\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/154/art/1766022138\",\"duration\":8571722,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2005-12-07\",\"addedAt\":1762638087,\"updatedAt\":1766022138,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"chapterSource\":\"media\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/162\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.ripe\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":410,\"duration\":8571722,\"bitrate\":6526,\"width\":3840,\"height\":1632,\"aspectRatio\":2.35,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"eac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"hevc\",\"videoResolution\":\"4k\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"main 10\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":410,\"key\":\"/library/parts/410/1615387715/file.mkv\",\"duration\":8571722,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/The Chronicles of Narnia The Lion the Witch and the Wardrobe (2005)  [2160p x265 10bit FS93 Joy]/The Chronicles of Narnia The Lion the Witch and the Wardrobe (2005)  [2160p x265 10bit FS93 Joy].mkv\",\"size\":6991955291,\"container\":\"mkv\",\"failureBIFResultCode\":\"3\",\"failureBIFRetryCount\":\"1\",\"hasThumbnail\":\"1\",\"videoProfile\":\"main 10\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"The Chronicles of Narnia: The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/154/thumb/1766022138\"},{\"alt\":\"The Chronicles of Narnia: The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/154/art/1766022138\"},{\"alt\":\"The Chronicles of Narnia: The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe\",\"type\"