,\"contentRatingAge\":14,\"summary\":\"Kai—an outcast—joins Oishi, the leader of 47 outcast samurai.  Together they seek vengeance upon the treacherous overlord who killed their master and banished their kind.  To restore honour to their homeland, the warriors embark upon a quest that challenges them with a series of trials that would destroy ordinary warriors.\",\"rating\":1.6,\"audienceRating\":4.8,\"year\":2013,\"tagline\":\"For courage. For loyalty. For honor.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/22119/thumb/1766232016\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/22119/art/1766232016\",\"duration\":7123126,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2013-12-06\",\"addedAt\":1766232002,\"updatedAt\":1766232016,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.spilled\",\"chapterSource\":\"media\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/22121\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.rotten\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":46472,\"duration\":7123126,\"bitrate\":36290,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"aspectRatio\":1.78,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"dca-ma\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"audioProfile\":\"ma\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":46472,\"key\":\"/library/parts/46472/1641135702/file.mkv\",\"duration\":7123126,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/47.Ronin.2013.BluRay.1080p.AVC.DTS-HD.MA.5.1.REMUX-FraMeSToR/47.Ronin.2013.BluRay.1080p.AVC.DTS-HD.MA.5.1.REMUX-FraMeSToR.mkv\",\"size\":32312016100,\"audioProfile\":\"ma\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"failureBIFResultCode\":\"3\",\"failureBIFRetryCount\":\"2\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"47 Ronin\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/22119/thumb/1766232016\"},{\"alt\":\"47 Ronin\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/22119/art/1766232016\"},{\"alt\":\"47 Ronin\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/22119/clearLogo/1766232016\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"472302\",\"topRight\":\"8d4633\",\"bottomRight\":\"894b18\",\"bottomLeft\":\"9a3641\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Action\"},{\"tag\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"Japan\"},{\"tag\":\"United States of America\"}],\"Director\":[{\"tag\":\"Carl Rinsch\"}],\"Writer\":[{\"tag\":\"Chris Morgan\"},{\"tag\":\"Hossein Amini\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"Keanu Reeves\"},{\"tag\":\"Hiroyuki Sanada\"},{\"tag\":\"Ko Shibasaki\"}]},{\"ratingKey\":\"19158\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/19158\",\"guid\":\"plex://movie/645e8f63c345e3fb3550f5a1\",\"slug\":\"200-wolf-2024\",\"studio\":\"Studio 100 Animation\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"200% Wolf\",\"librarySectionTitle\":\"Movies\",\"librarySectionID\":1,\"librarySectionKey\":\"/library/sections/1\",\"contentRating\":\"PG\",\"contentRatingAge\":8,\"summary\":\"Heroic poodle Freddy Lupin has everything it takes to lead his werewolf pack. Except respect. If only he were more... wolfish. But when a wayward wish transforms him into a werewolf and deposits a mischievous moon spirit on earth, Freddy must restore the cosmic order before earth and moon collide. Oops. One thing's for sure - Freddy will never question being a poodle again.\",\"audienceRating\":5.8,\"year\":2024,\"tagline\":\"When 100% isn't enough.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/19158/thumb/1766036260\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/19158/art/1766036260\",\"duration\":5893417,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2024-06-06\",\"addedAt\":1766036258,\"updatedAt\":1766036260,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"imdb://image.rating\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":41144,\"duration\":5893417,\"bitrate\":6725,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"aspectRatio\":1.78,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"ac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"constrained baseline\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":41144,\"key\":\"/library/parts/41144/1746999759/file.mkv\",\"duration\":5893417,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/20