"contentRatingAge\":14,\"summary\":\"When a documentary crew traveling through the Amazon jungle, picks up a stranded man, they are unaware of the trouble that will occur. This stranger's hobby is to capture the giant Anaconda snake, and plans to continue targeting it on their boat, by any means necessary.\",\"rating\":4.0,\"audienceRating\":2.4,\"year\":1997,\"tagline\":\"When you can't breathe, you can't scream.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/26483/thumb/1767081424\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/26483/art/1767081424\",\"duration\":5360405,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"1997-04-11\",\"addedAt\":1767081416,\"updatedAt\":1767081424,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.spilled\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/26485\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.rotten\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":63130,\"duration\":5360405,\"bitrate\":3107,\"width\":1920,\"height\":804,\"aspectRatio\":2.35,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"aac\",\"videoCodec\":\"hevc\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"audioProfile\":\"lc\",\"videoProfile\":\"main\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":63130,\"key\":\"/library/parts/63130/1766917474/file.mkv\",\"duration\":5360405,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/Anaconda 1997 REMASTERED 1080p (Multi) BluRay HEVC x265 5.1 BONE/Anaconda 1997 REMASTERED 1080p (Multi) BluRay HEVC x265 5.1 BONE.mkv\",\"size\":2081662050,\"audioProfile\":\"lc\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"indexes\":\"sd\",\"videoProfile\":\"main\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"Anaconda\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/26483/thumb/1767081424\"},{\"alt\":\"Anaconda\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/26483/art/1767081424\"},{\"alt\":\"Anaconda\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/26483/clearLogo/1767081424\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"4c1e0f\",\"topRight\":\"335d9c\",\"bottomRight\":\"8b3428\",\"bottomLeft\":\"4b1e1a\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Action\"},{\"tag\":\"Adventure\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"Brazil\"},{\"tag\":\"Peru\"}],\"Director\":[{\"tag\":\"Luis Llosa\"}],\"Writer\":[{\"tag\":\"Jack Epps Jr.\"},{\"tag\":\"Hans Bauer\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"Jennifer Lopez\"},{\"tag\":\"Ice Cube\"},{\"tag\":\"Jon Voight\"}]},{\"ratingKey\":\"26487\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/26487\",\"guid\":\"plex://movie/5f4090161ae710004114916b\",\"slug\":\"anaconda-2024-1\",\"studio\":\"Xiang Brothers Pictures\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Anaconda\",\"librarySectionTitle\":\"Movies\",\"librarySectionID\":1,\"librarySectionKey\":\"/library/sections/1\",\"originalTitle\":\"狂蟒之灾\",\"summary\":\"A re-interpretation of the iconic '90s creature feature, in which a group of circus athletes - having found themselves stranded in a rain forest - come face-to-face with the elements, a bloodthirsty poacher, and a formidable giant snake.\",\"audienceRating\":4.9,\"year\":2024,\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/26487/thumb/1767081431\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/26487/art/1767081431\",\"duration\":5044256,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2024-03-01\",\"addedAt\":1767081424,\"updatedAt\":1767081431,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"imdb://image.rating\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":63136,\"duration\":5044256,\"bitrate\":1665,\"width\":1920,\"height\":808,\"aspectRatio\":2.35,\"audioChannels\":2,\"audioCodec\":\"eac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":63136,\"key\":\"/library/parts/63136/1732119366/file.mkv\",\"duration\":5044256,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/Anaconda.2024.1080p.WEB-DL.H264.DDP2.0-DreamHD/Anaconda.2024.1080p.WEB-DL.H264.DDP2.0-DreamHD.mkv\",\"size\":1049699407,\"container\":\"mkv\",\"indexes\":\"sd\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"Anaconda\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/26487/thumb/1767081431\"},{\"alt\":\"Anaconda\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/26487/art/1767081431\"},{\"alt\":\"Anaconda\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/26487/clearLogo/1767081431\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"020e0c\",\"topRight\":\"572321\",\"bottomRight\":\"240304\",\"bottomLeft\":\"040c03\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Action\"},{\"tag\":\"Adventure\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"China\"}],\"Director\":[{\"tag\":\"Xiang Qiuliang\"},{\"tag\":\"Xiang Hesheng\"}],\"Writer\":[{\"tag\":\"FOXFOXBEE\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"Nita Xia\"},{\"tag\":\"Terence Yin Chi-Wai\"},{\"tag\":\"Wang Xingchen\"}]},{\"ratingKey\":\"28666\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/28666\",\"guid\":\"plex://movie/66cab8bc55469f6cd8d0624d\",\"slug\":\"anaconda-2025\",\"studio\":\"Fully Formed Entertainment\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Anaconda\",\"librarySectionTitle\":\"Movies\",\"librarySectionID\":1,\"librarySectionKey\":\"/library/sections/1\",\"contentRating\":\"PG-13\",\"contentRatingAge\":13,\"summary\":\"Four childhood friends are going through a midlife crisis so they decide to remake their favorite horror movie from the 1990s in the Amazon Forest When a real giant anaconda shows up, they get more than what they bargain for and their comically chaotic movie making turns into a life-or-death situation. The movie that they're dying to remake? It might just kill them, literally.\",\"rating\":5.1,\"audienceRating\":7.6,\"year\":2025,\"tagline\":\"A comedy so big it'll leave you breathless.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/28666/thumb/1768286083\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/28666/art/1768286083\",\"duration\":5654080,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2025-12-24\",\"addedAt\":1768286081,\"updatedAt\":1768286083,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/28667\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.rotten\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":68932,\"duration\":5654080,\"bitrate\":11172,\"width\":1920,\"height\":816,\"aspectRatio\":2.35,\"audioChannels\":2,\"audioCodec\":\"aac\",\"vid