a8c78\",\"slug\":\"argylle\",\"studio\":\"Marv\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Argylle\",\"librarySectionTitle\":\"Movies\",\"librarySectionID\":1,\"librarySectionKey\":\"/library/sections/1\",\"contentRating\":\"PG-13\",\"contentRatingAge\":13,\"summary\":\"Elly Conway, a reserved writer of spy stories who rarely ventures outside, finds her life entangled with actual secret service operations as the narratives she pens eerily mirror the operations of a menacing covert group. Aiden, professing to be an agent, intervenes to protect her from potential abduction or worse. Suddenly, Elly, along with her cherished feline, Alfie, find themselves navigating a shadowy realm filled with deceit and illusions.\",\"rating\":3.3,\"audienceRating\":7.0,\"year\":2024,\"tagline\":\"The greater the spy, the bigger the lie.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/22295/thumb/1766232145\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/22295/art/1766232145\",\"duration\":8336352,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2024-01-31\",\"addedAt\":1766232136,\"updatedAt\":1766232145,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.upright\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/22306\",\"ratingImage\":\"rottentomatoes://image.rating.rotten\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":46944,\"duration\":8336352,\"bitrate\":12178,\"width\":1920,\"height\":800,\"aspectRatio\":2.35,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"ac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":46944,\"key\":\"/library/parts/46944/1711138228/file.mkv\",\"duration\":8336352,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/movies/Argylle.2024.1080p.AMZN.WEB-DL.H.264-EniaHD/Argylle.2024.1080p.AMZN.WEB-DL.H.264-EniaHD.mkv\",\"size\":12689982987,\"container\":\"mkv\",\"failureBIFResultCode\":\"3\",\"failureBIFRetryCount\":\"2\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\"}]}],\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"Argylle\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/22295/thumb/1766232145\"