rns why you should never lend a helping hand.\",\"index\":3,\"parentIndex\":1,\"audienceRating\":7.1,\"viewCount\":2,\"lastViewedAt\":1768452651,\"year\":2015,\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/10789/thumb/1762786230\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/10786/art/1762788064\",\"parentThumb\":\"/library/metadata/10786/thumb/1762788064\",\"grandparentThumb\":\"/library/metadata/8100/thumb/1767893636\",\"grandparentArt\":\"/library/metadata/8100/art/1767893636\",\"grandparentTheme\":\"/library/metadata/8100/theme/1767893636\",\"duration\":1292041,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2015-12-28\",\"addedAt\":1762786230,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"themoviedb://image.rating\",\"Media\":[{\"id\":18846,\"duration\":1292041,\"bitrate\":4142,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"aspectRatio\":1.78,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"eac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"hevc\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"main 10\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":18846,\"key\":\"/library/parts/18846/1767299608/file.mkv\",\"duration\":1292041,\"file\":\"/pd_zurg/shows/Superstore (2015) Season 1-6 S01-S06 (1080p AMZN WEB-DL x265 HEVC 10bit EAC3 5.1 Silence)/Superstore (2015) - S01E03 - Shots and Salsa (1080p AMZN WEB-DL x265 Silence).mkv\",\"size\":669027268,\"container\":\"mkv\",\"failureBIFResultCode\":\"3\",\"failureBIFRetryCount\":\"4\",\"videoProfile\":\"main 10\"}]},{\"id\":55641,\"duration\":1292041,\"bitrate\":13734,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"aspectRatio\":1.78,\"audioChannels\":6,\"audioCodec\":\"eac3\",\"videoCodec\":\"h264\",\"videoResolution\":\"1080\",\"container\":\"mkv\",\"videoFrameRate\":\"24p\",\"videoProfile\":\"high\",\"hasVoiceActivity\":false,\"Part\":[{\"id\":55641,\"key\":\"/library/parts/55641/1755771958/file.mkv\",\"duration\":1292041,\"file\":\"/all/pd_zurg/mnt/pd_zurg/shows/Superstore.S01.1080p.AMZN.WEB-DL.DDP5.1.x264/Superstore.S01E03.Shots.and.Salsa.1080p.AMZN.WEB-DL.DD+.5.1.x264.mkv\",\"size\":2218070844,\"container\":