ferb\",\"studio\":\"Disney Television Animation\",\"type\":\"show\",\"title\":\"Phineas and Ferb\",\"librarySectionTitle\":\"TV Shows\",\"librarySectionID\":5,\"librarySectionKey\":\"/library/sections/5\",\"contentRating\":\"TV-G\",\"contentRatingAge\":5,\"summary\":\"Each day, two kindhearted suburban stepbrothers on summer vacation embark on some grand new project, which annoys their controlling sister, Candace, who tries to bust them. Meanwhile, their pet platypus plots against evil Dr. Doofenshmirtz.\",\"index\":1,\"audienceRating\":7.9,\"year\":2007,\"tagline\":\"There is no such thing as an ordinary day to Phineas and Ferb.\",\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/28799/thumb/1768631390\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/28799/art/1768631390\",\"theme\":\"/library/metadata/28799/theme/1768631390\",\"duration\":900000,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"2007-08-17\",\"leafCount\":186,\"viewedLeafCount\":0,\"childCount\":4,\"addedAt\":1768631378,\"updatedAt\":1768631390,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"themoviedb://image.rating\",\"primaryExtraKey\":\"/library/metadata/28804\",\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"Phineas and Ferb\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/28799/thumb/1768631390\"},{\"alt\":\"Phineas and Ferb\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/28799/art/1768631390\"},{\"alt\":\"Phineas and Ferb\",\"type\":\"clearLogo\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/28799/clearLogo/1768631390\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"412708\",\"topRight\":\"246c57\",\"bottomRight\":\"127032\",\"bottomLeft\":\"2b5e2b\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Family\"},{\"tag\":\"Animation\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"United States of America\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"Dee Bradley Baker\"},{\"tag\":\"Caroline Rhea\"},{\"tag\":\"Vincent Martella\"}]},{\"ratingKey\":\"28934\",\"key\":\"/library/metadata/28934/children\",\"guid\":\"plex://show/5d9c08187b5c2e001e65431a\",\"slug\":\"taotao\",\"studio\":\"Shunmao\",\"type\":\"show\",\"title\":\"Taotao\",\"librarySectionTitle\":\"TV Shows\",\"librarySectionID\":5,\"librarySectionKey\":\"/library/sections/5\",\"originalTitle\":\"タオタオ絵本館 世界動物ばなし\",\"summary\":\"A spin-off of the animated film \\\"Shunmao Monogatari Taotao\\\" (1981). The series focuses on the childhood of the panda Taotao. He regularly listens to folktales narrated by his mother, whose intention is to teach him the moral lessons of he tales.\",\"index\":1,\"audienceRating\":6.3,\"year\":1983,\"thumb\":\"/library/metadata/28934/thumb/1768635833\",\"art\":\"/library/metadata/28934/art/1768635833\",\"theme\":\"/library/metadata/28934/theme/1768635833\",\"duration\":1440000,\"originallyAvailableAt\":\"1983-10-07\",\"leafCount\":38,\"viewedLeafCount\":0,\"childCount\":1,\"addedAt\":1768635506,\"updatedAt\":1768635833,\"audienceRatingImage\":\"themoviedb://image.rating\",\"Image\":[{\"alt\":\"Taotao\",\"type\":\"coverPoster\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/28934/thumb/1768635833\"},{\"alt\":\"Taotao\",\"type\":\"background\",\"url\":\"/library/metadata/28934/art/1768635833\"}],\"UltraBlurColors\":{\"topLeft\":\"120306\",\"topRight\":\"0f020d\",\"bottomRight\":\"a8261e\",\"bottomLeft\":\"a1311f\"},\"Genre\":[{\"tag\":\"Adventure\"},{\"tag\":\"Animation\"}],\"Country\":[{\"tag\":\"Japan\"}],\"Role\":[{\"tag\":\"TARAKO\"},{\"tag\":\"Taeko Nakanishi\"},{\"tag\":\"Toru Furuya\"}]}]}}"
